    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins in a dull office, where our blue hero is tasked with delivering files to management. But something is off. Coworkers behave strangely, and parts of the building seem unfamiliar. As the protagonist explores further, he enters restricted areas and encounter hostile figures. A sudden chase by a nighmarish creature leads to a collapse of reality, and the story shifts into a surreal, dreamlike world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From there, the platforming journey unfolds across 7 levels and 60 areas. Each level introduces new challenges, visual styles, and mechanics that require increasingly precise movement and timing. Bosses await at the end of every level, each presenting a different kind of challenge. The difficulty is consistent but fair, encouraging persistence and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pixel graphics are clean and focused, highlighting movement and level design. The game blends platforming, shooting, and light puzzle elements without relying on dialogue. Story is conveyed through progression and atmosphere. What starts as a simple task turns into a strange and demanding journey through shifting environments and hidden threats.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins in a dull office, where our blue hero is tasked with delivering files to management. But something is off. Coworkers behave strangely, and parts of the building seem unfamiliar. As the protagonist explores further, he enters restricted areas and encounter hostile figures. A sudden chase by a nighmarish creature leads to a collapse of reality, and the story shifts into a surreal, dreamlike world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From there, the platforming journey unfolds across 7 levels and 60 areas. Each level introduces new challenges, visual styles, and mechanics that require increasingly precise movement and timing. Bosses await at the end of every level, each presenting a different kind of challenge. The difficulty is consistent but fair, encouraging persistence and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pixel graphics are clean and focused, highlighting movement and level design. The game blends platforming, shooting, and light puzzle elements without relying on dialogue. Story is conveyed through progression and atmosphere. What starts as a simple task turns into a strange and demanding journey through shifting environments and hidden threats.</p>",
    "short_description": "Follow our blue hero through a challenging 2D platformer filled with precision jumps, fast-paced shooting, and clever puzzles. Each pixel-art level rewards skill, timing, and persistence. Overcome tricky obstacles and uncover new mechanics as the journey unfolds.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
